{"candidateAnswer":"Early July 2023, after getting a promotional membership deal.","evidence":"[D19:1 | 7:20 pm on 16 June, 2023] Maria: Hey John, been good since we talked? I got some great news to share - I joined a gym last week! It's been super positive - I'm sticking to my workout routine and the people are awesome. The atmosphere is so welcoming.","itemId":"urn:uuid:889ca2b0-f772-5a32-b873-12f4b105cce7","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:517437b4c65ef06bada88832c49435948366b4134cb50f8ba9099aa85fe8da14","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Maria join a gym?","referenceAnswer":"The week before 16 June 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"517437b4c65ef06bada88832c49435948366b4134cb50f8ba9099aa85fe8da14"}}]}